	(text "Supplies (RP2350 datasheet 6.3.7): IOVDD, QSPI_IOVDD, USB_OTP_VDD, ADC_AVDD and VREG_VIN on +3V3_RP, the\nAP2112K LDO that rises with +5V; the core regulator switches VREG_LX through 3.3 uH onto DVDD (VREG_FB senses\nit), its analog supply VREG_AVDD through 33R / 4.7 uF.  One 100 nF at every supply pin, drawn at the pin it serves.\nRESET resets the RP2354B and the ESP32-S3 together (D5 steers RST_BTN onto RUN and S3_EN).  Hold BOOTSEL while\npressing RESET for the RP's USB boot ROM.  The S3 does both: IO4 (RUN_CTL) low resets the RP, IO5 (BOOTSEL_CTL)\nlow through that reset selects BOOTSEL.  QSPI_SD0-3 / SCLK unused: the 2 MB flash is in the package."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 68.58 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "05063f70-3e62-59c8-a1e0-a94d1dbdc0e6")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
